# A YouTube link, downloaded with yt-dlp into the run's own cache and
# played from there. Run with LANTERN_CONFIG=scripts/e2e/yt-dlp.toml: yt-dlp
# plays only when chosen (youtube-official.script is the usual way). Needs the network. The
# cache starts empty, so the take comes before the download: the stage stays black
# until the file arrives and then plays.
add https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jNQXAC9IVRw
next
play
wait 500
shot 1-downloading
wait-ready 120
wait 2000
shot 2-early
wait 5000
shot 3-later
# A video that doesn't exist fails instead of staying black forever.
show https://youtu.be/AAAAAAAAAAA
wait-ready 60
wait 300
shot 4-failed
